"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fphoto.php%3Ffbid%3D1503673324904548&set=a.362283715710187&type=3+-+%22Ashlee%2C+what+have+you+even+done+for+the+District+since+you%27ve+been+elected%3F%22+is+a+question+I%27m+happy+to+answer.+In+my+day+job+I+have+performance+evaluations+regularly+where+my+boss+and+I+go+over+what+I%27m+doing+to+make+sure+that+what+I%27m+doing+is+what+they+need+me+to+do.+I%27m+this+job%2C+YOU+are+my+boss.+I%27d+love+to+hear+what+I+can+do+to+better+serve+our+District.+HB181%3A+Offender+Employment+AmendmentsThis+bill+created+an+online+portal+that+connected+individuals+that+are+currently+incarcerated+and+about+to+be+released+with+jobs+that+they+are+eligible+for%2C+even+with+a+criminal+record.+This+portal+is+housed+and+maintained+under+the+Department+of+Workforce+Services.+We+know+that+stable+employment+is+the+first+step+to+securing+housing%2C+paying+back+court+fees%2C+catching+up+on+child+support.+We+want+to+make+sure+that+our+neighbors+starting+over+again+have+all+the+tools+they+need+to+continue+their+upwards+trajectory.+You+can+read+the+full+bill+here%3Ashare.google%2F1BB2UOcCqokgpK9zi"
},
